{"v":1,"id":"sIpQ8no92uYPTG03spX6","createdAt":"2026-08-09T18:32:41.822Z","app":{"name":"AxiVale","version":"1.3.5"},"kind":"conversation","title":"prepare a summary report for wvw fights in blue borderland today","turns":[{"userText":"prepare a summary report for wvw fights in blue borderland today","agentText":"\n\nLogged the day's single WvW run. Let me pull stability output to complete the support picture.\n\n## WvW Report — 21 Jun 2026\n\n**Rough night: we won the sustain battle but lost the kill battle, going 2–4 with a 0.24 K/D as 127 squad deaths buried 30 enemy kills.**\n\nOne run was logged today — \"Aggressives Albino\" under commander Aggressives Albino, 6 fights, 36 avg squad vs 37 avg enemies (no skipped fights). One caveat up front: the report metadata doesn't carry the map name, so I can't confirm this was Blue Borderland specifically — it's the only WvW run recorded today. We took **176 downs / 127 deaths** while inflicting **58 downs / 30 deaths** — the squad got pressured down far more than it pressured back, and only converted 2 fights into wins.\n\nPressure was carried by a handful of damage dealers; here's where the down contribution actually came from:\n\n{{figure}}\n\n### Damage & pressure — top 7 of 37\n| Player | Spec | Down contrib | Deaths |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| occamsbutterfly | Weaver | 245,474 | 3 |\n| Miezmu | Evoker | 242,748 | 2 |\n| Oink | Dragonhunter | 222,688 | 4 |\n| Althea | Herald | 171,544 | 4 |\n| DarkShadow | Necromancer | 139,869 | 4 |\n| BLOEK | Spellbreaker | 136,520 | 4 |\n| astarte | Reaper | 107,530 | 4 |\n\n### Support — top 8 of 37\n| Player | Spec | Strips | Cleanses | Healing | Stab (group-gen s) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| eXelsius | Specter | 4 | 840 | 1,535,427 | — |\n| Kasaran | Druid | 2 | 690 | 1,220,439 | — |\n| BRDiger | Scrapper | 2 | 963 | 1,123,455 | — |\n| Rexirot | Druid | 1 | 392 | 795,803 | — |\n| Donner | Luminary | 3 | 354 | 99,863 | 3,800 |\n| LadyLucky | Firebrand | 12 | 110 | 37,573 | 3,533 |\n| BLOEK | Spellbreaker | 382 | 34 | 6,687 | 538 |\n| Mantis | Spellbreaker | 299 | 22 | 0 | 0 |\n\nFull 37-player breakdown is in the Actions panel.\n\n**What went well**\n- **Elite sustain core:** eXelsius (Specter) posted 1.53M healing with **0 deaths/0 downs**, plus Kasaran (1.22M) and BRDiger (1.12M heal + a squad-high 963 cleanses).\n- **Strip pressure was real:** BLOEK 382, Mantis 299, DarkShadow 281, with five more players over 230 — boon-rip was never the problem.\n- **Top-end cleave spiked hard:** occamsbutterfly, Miezmu and Oink each drove 220k+ down contribution.\n\n**What to improve**\n- **Downs aren't converting to safety:** 176 squad downs collapsed into 127 deaths despite huge healing — that's a peel/stomp-denial and positioning failure, not a lack of healers. Even fights (36 v 37) shouldn't bleed a 0.24 K/D.\n- **DPS getting caught:** almost every carry sat at 4 deaths (Oink, Althea, astarte, Bunio, ikiturso 6) — they're overextending into the bomb instead of cleaving from the edge.\n- **Stability is thin and concentrated:** real group-stab came from only ~5 sources (Donner, LadyLucky, Kitty, the two Paragons); confirm every subgroup has its own stab so pushes don't get chain-CC'd.\n\n**Highest-leverage fix for next week:** tighten the melee train's positioning so downs get rezzed/peeled instead of stomped — the sustain output is already there, but 176→127 downs-to-deaths means the squad is fighting too loose and feeding cleave. Reining that in flips the K/D faster than any build change.\n\n(Positioning replay was off for this run — degree \"none\" — so I can't map death geography. Enable precise replay in AxiBridge settings and I can pinpoint exactly where the squad is overextending.)","filedAt":"7:37 PM","tools":[{"name":"load_skill"},{"name":"axibridge_runs_list"},{"name":"axibridge_run_summary","display":{"kind":"table","data":{"title":"Aggressives Albino — 2W/4L over 6 fights","columns":[{"key":"account","label":"Account"},{"key":"professi