th **0 deaths/0 downs**, the cleanest carry of the night\n\n**Support standouts:**\n- Salubrious (Druid) — 4.54M healing (top); Alambok (Druid) — 4.39M heal + 2,322 cleanses (top cleanser)\n- Strips: anonymously (Necro) 996, mjthedk (Tempest) 976, matahari (Ritualist) 810 — boon-rip was not the problem\n\n**Biggest issue:** the death count. Nearly every frontliner sat at 7–13 deaths (cyruschi 13, Salubrious/Aeris/ashadyfigure 10) despite four healers pushing 2M+ healing — that points to overextension and getting bombed, not a lack of sustain. Fixing positioning so downs get peeled instead of stomped is the single highest-leverage change.\n\nFull 61-player breakdown is in the Actions panel. Want the full WvW report treatment (charts + top-performer tables + positioning), or is this summary enough?","filedAt":"7:25 PM","tools":[{"name":"axibridge_run_summary","display":{"kind":"table","data":{"title":"Four K Ping Sil — 2W/13L over 15 fights","columns":[{"key":"account","label":"Account"},{"key":"profession","label":"Profession"},{"key":"damage","label":"Damage"},{"key":"downContribution","label":"Down contrib"},{"key":"cleanses","label":"Cleanses"},{"key":"strips","label":"Strips"},{"key":"healing","label":"Healing"},{"key":"deaths","label":"Deaths"}],"rows":[{"account":"Azulean.1728","profession":"Amalgam","damage":4524178,"downContribution":243711,"cleanses":142,"strips":12,"healing":232793,"deaths":8,"downs":12},{"account":"Alambok.5319","profession":"Druid","damage":42541,"downContribution":3476,"cleanses":2322,"strips":4,"healing":4385029,"deaths":9,"downs":10},{"account":"Sil.9715","profession":"Luminary","damage":385078,"downContribution":23156,"cleanses":491,"strips":9,"healing":839991,"deaths":7,"downs":10},{"account":"caasig.9634","profession":"Troubadour","damage":241049,"downContribution":9355,"cleanses":644,"strips":6,"healing":782384,"deaths":3,"downs":3},{"account":"SiNClaR.6184","profession":"Vindicator","damage":89931,"downContribution":3550,"cleanses