smer presence.** Of ~29.4k incoming applications: Bleeding 9,218 and **Torment 9,056** dominate, then Burning 4,784, Confusion 3,124, Poison 3,049. Heavy Torment alongside heavy Bleeding is the classic Scourge signature — and a lot of it is likely **boon corruption** (Scourge turning our boons into torment/bleed), which fits a night where we got chain-pressured.\n- **Burning ~4.8k** suggests at least a few condi Firebrands/Guardians in the mix; **Confusion ~3.1k** means one or more Mesmers (Mirage/Chrono).\n- **Almost no Chill (62), Fear (12) or Immobilize (11).** That's telling — very little of the soft-CC/kiting condi you'd see from a Reaper-heavy or immob-focused comp. Their disables came as hard CC instead: **1,609 CC events received**, consistent with power CC (Spellbreaker/Guardian/Herald) breaking our stab before the bomb.\n\n**Best-guess enemy profile:** a power-melee train (the source of that 96% power damage and 1.6k hard CC) fronted by a Scourge corrupt/condi backline, plus a sprinkle of condi guard and mesmer. That combination — strip/corrupt your boons, hard-CC through stab, then power-bomb — matches the outcome exactly: 410 downs and 297 deaths for only 18 kills.\n\nCaveat: this is reverse-engineered from incoming damage and conditions, not a real enemy roster — AxiBridge doesn't publish enemy professions, so treat class counts as directional, not exact.","filedAt":"7:30 PM","tools":[{"name":"axibridge_find","display":{"kind":"table","data":{"title":"Sections for \"enemy composition, incoming conditions and crowd control by skill, what professions hit us\"","columns":[{"key":"section","label":"Section"},{"key":"title","label":"What"},{"key":"granularities","label":"Granularity"}],"rows":[{"section":"crowd_control","title":"Crowd control (received)","granularities":"player, squad"},{"section":"crowd_control_out","title":"Crowd control (applied)","granularities":"player, squad"},{"section":"conditions_out","title":"Outgoing conditions","granularities":"p